          "body": "Patch applied (with some line wraps) in revision 671515. Thanks!\n\nPS. The official list of media types is available at http://www.iana.org/assignments/media-types/index.html and lists  \tapplication/vnd.ms-excel and application/vnd.ms-powerpoint as the proper media types for Excel and PowerPoint documents. However, having commonly used aliases recognized by the text extractors can only help.",
